<title>JAPAN: Chubu Shiryo - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Chubu Shiryo - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 36.30		vs	   27.86</p>
<p> Operating	  799 million	 vs	  862 million</p>
<p> Current	    752 million	 vs	  787 million</p>
<p> Net		  412 million	 vs	  367 million</p>
<p> EPS		   16.01 yen	  vs	   14.27 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     26 million	  vs	  26 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Chubu Shiryo Co Ltd is a leading feedstuff manufacturer.</p>
